<<
/Title (However, implementing DNSSEC validation directly on resource-constrained IoT devices can introduce much more computational and memory overhead than required. Here is where gateway-assisted DNSSEC offers an optimisation, by delegating the validation to a gateway while allowing the client to communicate with it through an authenticated, encrypted connection using TLP \(Transport Layer Protocol\). Thus, this approach aims to reduce client-side processing requirements while preserving DNS validation outcomes, as necessary.)
